{"ticker":"RGTI","updated":"2026-11-20T23:17:03Z","profile":{"longName":"Rigetti Computing, Inc.","shortName":"Rigetti Computing, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Computer Hardware","country":"United States","website":"https://www.rigetti.com","fullTimeEmployees":162,"marketCap":2454326272,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":-32.844036,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":191.48991,"pegRatio":null,"targetMeanPrice":19.57077,"targetHighPrice":40.0,"targetLowPrice":7.12,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":13,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.275,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.39596,"operatingMargins":-8.56644,"profitMargins":0.0,"totalRevenue":12817000,"beta":2.153,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":30.205,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":7.08,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NCM","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Rigetti Computing, Inc., through its subsidiaries, builds and operates quantum computers and the superconducting quantum processors the United States, the United Kingdom, rest of Europe, Asia, and internationally. The company offers quantum processing units (QPUs) and quantum computing systems to provide access to quantum computing systems through the cloud in the form of quantum computing as a service (QCaaS). It provides Novera, a 9-qubit chip QPU that features tunable couplers for fast two-qubit operations and a 5-qubit chip for testing single-qubit operations; Novera QPU that is based in fourth generation Ankaa-class architecture; 36-qubit Cepheus-1-36Q system, a multi-chip quantum computer; and 84-qubit Ankaa-3 quantum computer. The company also sells access to its quantum computers through QCaaS. In addition, the company offers Rigetti quantum cloud services, a platform that provides support for various range of programming capabilities, public or private clouds integration, and connectivity, as well as quantum operating system software that supports public and private cloud architectures. Further, it offers QCS Outpost, a distributed software environment for operating, administering, and monitoring the overall system; Rigetti Foundry Services that delivers superconducting quantum chips to advance and accelerate quantum information science and technology research and deve","summary_zh":"Rigetti Computer, Inc. 透過其子公司在美國、英國、歐洲其他地區、亞洲和國際上建造和營運量子電腦和超導量子處理器。該公司提供量子處理單元（QPU）和量子運算系統，以量子運算即服務（QCaaS）的形式透過雲端提供對量子運算系統的存取。它提供 Novera，一種 9 量子位元晶片 QPU，具有用於快速兩個量子位元操作的可調諧耦合器和用於測試單量子位元操作的 5 量子位元晶片；基於第四代Ankaa級架構的Nevera QPU；36量子位元Cepheus-1-36Q系統，多晶片量子電腦和 84 量子位元 84 量子位元。該公司還透過 QCaaS 出售其量子電腦的使用權。此外，該公司還提供Rigetti量子雲服務，該平台為各種程式設計功能、公有或私有雲整合和連接提供支持，以及支援公有和私有雲架構的量子作業系統軟體。此外，它還提供 QCS Outpost，這是一個用於操作、管理和監控整個系統的分散式軟體環境； Rigetti Foundry Services 提供超導量子晶片，以推進和加速量子資訊科學技術的研究和開發","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"電腦硬體","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-22","o":26.33,"h":29.59,"l":25.5,"c":28.37,"v":87217900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":29.39,"h":32.4,"l":28.841,"c":31.46,"v":103564700},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":32.68,"h":34.4,"l":29.71,"c":31.64,"v":141839200},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":29.815,"h":32.83,"l":28.78,"c":32.1,"v":129306900},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":32.155,"h":33.98,"l":30.74,"c":31.18,"v":100109900},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":31.83,"h":32.535,"l":28.45,"c":29.65,"v":95487600},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":29.22,"h":30.624,"l":28.97,"c":29.79,"v":72038300},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":29.1,"h":31.39,"l":28.65,"c":29.85,"v":84797300},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":30.67,"h":35.81,"l":30.46,"c":35.4,"v":146006200},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":36.99,"h":40.63,"l":35.75,"c":40.06,"v":155531200},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":38.805,"h":43.11,"l":38.367,"c":41.71,"v":110767900},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":43.65,"h":46.18,"l":40.71,"c":43.91,"v":174843700},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":44.26,"h":48.23,"l":41.46,"c":43.23,"v":166627500},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":43.34,"h":48.22,"l":42.89,"c":47.11,"v":155458400},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":47.83,"h":49.13,"l":43.89,"c":43.92,"v":138979700},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":46.46,"h":55.23,"l":46.37,"c":54.91,"v":181160700},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":54.845,"h":58.15,"l":50.0,"c":56.12,"v":148012800},{"t":"2025-10-